<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended sharply higher in heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 135.26 to 6587.16.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 6.13 to 397.62.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.61.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1840 to 764.</p>
<p>Volume was 506,853,680 compared with 406,776,720 on Monday.</p>
